\":\"保留v1.0多引擎经济结构、AI PCB与索尔思内部价值防重算判断；本次没有新的分部原件推翻此分析。\",\"material\":true,\"next\\_action\":\"\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-economics\",\"remaining\\_kind\":null,\"status\":\"answered\"\\},\"question\":\"传统FPC、AI PCB、光模块和精密组件分别通过什么经济机制形成可持续利润？\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-economics\"\\},\\{\"assessment\":\"author-declared-not-revalidated\",\"finding\":\\{\"evidence\":\\[\\],\"finding\":\"保留v1.0关于并购并表、负商誉与索尔思一次性条款修改收益的核算；新增研报预测不改变已知历史会计事实。\",\"material\":true,\"next\\_action\":\"\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-earnings\",\"remaining\\_kind\":null,\"status\":\"answered\"\\},\"question\":\"并购与经营成长如何区分；财务利润、非经常损益与持续经营利润能否跨期闭合？\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-earnings\"\\},\\{\"assessment\":\"author-declared-not-revalidated\",\"finding\":\\{\"evidence\":\\[0,2\\],\"finding\":\"原低收益世界偏向高倍数解释被修订：保持基础业务、股数和10%回报，2028成长倍数12/18/25/35对应集团收益235.67/163.78/123.52/93.95亿元，均回算124.20元。上海239.55亿元若可比持续股东收益，只需成长部分11.79倍；未签目标价。\",\"material\":true,\"next\\_action\":\"在更可靠归属利润、资本兑现或发行结果出现时重估；不重复原算术，也不把此条件闭合称已证明安全边际。\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-valuation\",\"remaining\\_kind\":null,\"status\":\"reframed\"\\},\"question\":\"截至2026-10-15价格隐含怎样的收入、利润、资本和持续期要求，是否存在可靠安全边际？\",\"question\\_id\":\"q-valuation\"\\}\\],\"review\\_flags\":\\[\"NONOPEN\\_FINDING\\_HAS\\_DECLARED\\_FOLLOWUP\"\\],\"schema\":\"research-continuation-plan-v1\",\"source\\_coverage\":\\{\"coverage\":\"this-page-only\",\"limitations\":\\[\\{\"error\":null,\"index\":0,\"original\\_verified\":false,\"reference\":\\{\"manifest\":\\{\"commit\":\"4afac97dd5fd0bfcb506e7b52af95f6b3f46fdb8\",\"path\":\"source-views/dsbj-relay-38838698248/08d9e84324249f6389274b465aa1900c36184ebe02f5c46836f4d0ee9819fa7d/manifest.json\",\"repository\":\"auguspp/Decision-OS-2\",\"sha256\":\"07c908d3092fb15efc0b8f4b1dc9120eba5a93ac4b79b4d49d7148e835ecf2bd\"\\},\"selection\":\\{\"columns\":\\[\\],\"end\":null,\"kind\":\"all\",\"start\":null\\}\\},\"status\":\"stored-representation\"\\}\\],\"next\\_cursor\":\\{\"reference\":\\{\"commit\":\"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832\",