20元。上海239.55亿元若可比持续股东收益，只需成长部分11.79倍；未签目标价。","material":true,"next_action":"在更可靠归属利润、资本兑现或发行结果出现时重估；不重复原算术，也不把此条件闭合称已证明安全边际。","question_id":"q-valuation","remaining_kind":null,"status":"reframed"},"question":"截至2026-10-15价格隐含怎样的收入、利润、资本和持续期要求，是否存在可靠安全边际？","question_id":"q-valuation"}],"review_flags":["NONOPEN_FINDING_HAS_DECLARED_FOLLOWUP"],"schema":"research-continuation-plan-v1","source_coverage":{"coverage":"this-page-only","limitations":[{"error":null,"index":0,"original_verified":false,"reference":{"manifest":{"commit":"4afac97dd5fd0bfcb506e7b52af95f6b3f46fdb8","path":"source-views/dsbj-relay-38838698248/08d9e84324249f6389274b465aa1900c36184ebe02f5c46836f4d0ee9819fa7d/manifest.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"07c908d3092fb15efc0b8f4b1dc9120eba5a93ac4b79b4d49d7148e835ecf2bd"},"selection":{"columns":[],"end":null,"kind":"all","start":null}},"status":"stored-representation"}],"next_cursor":{"reference":{"commit":"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-5/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d4e6dfb14d19ed85fb3086b587b64077730f76d1723c72a7b0171c8431213ded"},"schema":"research-resume-cursor-v1","source_offset":1},"offset":0,"remaining":2,"returned":1,"total":3},"unresolved_challenges":[{"argument":"扩产收入增长可能伴随融资和营运资金侵蚀股东现金","disposition":"unresolved","evidence":[0,1,2],"question_id":"q-capital","response":"保留未解：Q2现金缺口扩大及营运资本吸收加强资本约束；对上海路径作资本/现金敏感性，仍无实际批次ROIC。停止无效追索不将挑战改为已解决。"},{"argument":"聚合页面的预测均值可能混入不同报告版本、转载日期或证券股本口径，不能未经Relay重建就称机构共识","disposition":"unresolved","evidence":[0,2],"question_id":"q-sellside","response":"保留未解：接口提供机构/期间原值但不能闭合所有原PDF日期与归属。已逐机构对照而不做共识，指定原件或可靠版本表作为重开条件。"}]},"kind":"full","mandate":"用户于2026-10-15直接委托东山精密（002384.SZ）Full Research，研究经济结构、跨期财务、并购与现金、竞争和扩张、估值、关键反证与合理接续。2026-10-15已明确授权将该案例原创研究成果公开保存到Decision OS 2.0 records；第三方付费原文、私密材料与正式人工Decision不在授权范围。研究截止2026-10-15；后续补证属于同一委托。旧本地案例标签DSBJ-002384SZ-20261015映射为本存储ID。","open_operation":"prepare","open_payload":{"reference":{"commit":"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-5/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d4e6dfb14d19ed85fb3086b587b64077730f76d1723c72a7b0171c8431213ded"}},"questions":[{"question_id":"q-economics","text":"传统FPC、AI PCB、光模块和精密组件分别通过什么经济机制形成可持续利润？"},{"question_id":"q-earnings","text":"并购与经营成长如何区分；财务利润、非经常损益与持续经营利润能否跨期闭合？"},{"question_id":"q-cash","text":"经营现金、营运资金、资本开支、债务与少数权益之后，普通股股东可得的现金到底是多少？"},{"question_id":"q-capital","text":"索尔思与AI PCB扩产需要多少可归因资本、客户订单和收益率；融资及稀释风险是否改变每股经济性？"},{"question_id":"q-valuation","text":"截至2026-10-15价格隐含怎样的收入、利润、资本和持续期要求，是否存在可靠安全边际？"},{"question_id":"q-sellside","text":"券商及外部经营预期与研究假设差在哪里，哪些证据能验证或否定最强竞争解释？"}],"recorded_unresolved":["[q-cash] currently-unidentifiable; see workpaper","[q-capital] currently-unidentifiable; see workpaper","[q-sellside] currently-unidentifiable; see workpaper","Unresolved challenges; see workpaper","Research interrupted/blocked; not a completed mandate","Research limitations; see workpaper"],"reference":{"commit":"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-5/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d4e6dfb14d19ed85fb3086b587b64077730f76d1723c72a7b0171c8431213ded"},"revision_id":"dsbj-20261016-v1-5","source_next_cursor":{"reference":{"commit":"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-5/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d4e6dfb14d19ed85fb3086b587b64077730f76d1723c72a7b0171c8431213ded"},"schema":"research-resume-cursor-v1","source_offset":1},"source_page":{"coverage":"this-page-only","offset":0,"remaining":2,"returned":1,"total":3},"source_statuses":[{"error":null,"index":0,"status":"stored-representation"}],"status":"readable","stored_at":"2026-10-16T04:42:36.801574+00:00"},"excerpt":{"body_sha256":"1a3ba3d0962640b4167953c9393019b6aba128aeb8584bd99f35d7e83f636191","end":11,"scope":"explicit-author-lines-not-a-new-summary","sha256":"382830dd4c30e4601d18729f2d437f28a0523ec070e4fcd87bc1a83f414c035f","start":1,"text":"# 东山精密 Full v1.5：不再等待原件，把分歧推进到利润与资本要求\n\n**研究与估值基准：2026年10月15日；本次分析：2026年10月16日。** 承接 v1.4，不重做 v1.0 的五年/八季基线，也不修改已归档的 HTML 和 Excel。本版是同一委托的经济分析增量，不是全新 Full、正式目标价或投资决定。接口原值来自已保管的 run 38838698248；本轮未重复发起成功查询，没有将10月16日的取数时间回填成历史首次可得时间。\n\n## 一、这次真正改变了什么判断\n\n**我撤回“现价主要只能靠很长的高倍数持续期解释”这一过宽表述。** 它仅适用于原模型较低的利润路径。若上海证券接口预测的2028年239.55亿元利润，能够转成同口径、可持续的普通股股东收益，那么在原有基础业务价值、股数和10%要求收益率不变的条件下，剩余成长业务只需约 **11.79倍** 即可正算回124.20元，并不需要35倍。\n\n因此，真正的分歧不是先争论“应给多少倍”，而是：**利润能否从原较强情景107.98亿元提升至200多亿元甚至更高；为得到这些利润需要多少资本；利润留下多少现金，以及能持续多久。** 不能用旧模型未覆盖乐观路径来证明股票必然贵，也不能用机构远期预测对应的低市盈率来证明便宜。所有下述机构数值均为预测，不是公司已实现结果。\n\nv1.0原参数与边界见本案确切历史版本：非光收益30亿元、光收入320亿元、光调整后净收益率25%、索尔思归属97.479%；原报告第九至十章。保留这些参数用于对照，不把它们升级为事实。\n"},"item":{"end":11,"reference":{"commit":"f78f4b0a8145349428e4936912e9c0fce865b832","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-5/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d4e6dfb14d19ed85fb3086b587b64077730f76d1723c72a7b0171c8431213ded"},"start":1},"predecessor":{"commit":"401a1b84a3f52e3143c4b146f761339a1857e569","path":"research/cases/dsbj-002384sz-20261015/revisions/dsbj-20261016-v1-4/record.json","repository":"auguspp/Decision-OS-2","sha256":"d038bb6e586938a110408bd56875720fde0d2e328358a18ec76c47ab014bea5e"},"status":"readable","version_id":"234ac532bb6cedda093bf7926cbf12dccb9fb642739d45bf3af679bfc186fa37"}],"time_basis":"stored-time-not-event-time-or-research-completion"},"schema":"dos2-news-edition-v2","window":{"as_of":"2026-10-16T09:04:47.720115+00:00","coverage":{"complete_news_coverage":false,"continuous_capture_verified":false,"failed_source_windows":10,"gap_meaning":"OBSERVATION_CLOCK_GAPS_NOT_PROOF_OF_NO_NEWS","maximum_observation_gap_seconds":60922.631273,"retained_batches":13,"retained_versions